    "Test coverage enhancement focuses on unit and integration tests for DSL and XML generation paths.",
    "Documentation is written in AsciiDoc and published via the project's existing doc build process.",
    "Hadoop distribution specific libraries are currently bundled in a single admin artifact; splitting requires modularization and profile-based builds.",
    "No major architectural changes beyond the described user stories.",
    "All development work is performed by a single developer (the estimator)."
  ],
